{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>When everything is devoured by the Abyss, Fight, even if it's just for the sake of feeling your heart beating.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Die Deep</strong> is an action game focused purely on the confrontation with your enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No exploration, no puzzles, no filler. The only core is <strong>Combat</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Observe enemy attacks, find their weaknesses, and devise strategies using precisely executed attacks. One careless mistake in battle, or get too greedy, and it's all over.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Control characters with distinct traits and goals. In a relentless cycle of fierce battles, pursue the mysterious power to rewrite fate. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Step into the Abyss. Face death.</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The World</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When everything is devoured by the Abyss, all desires turn to dust. Wandering souls have long forgotten the instinct to strive, and even the reason to live.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Until the Abyss sends a silent call. It lures you deeper to uncover the forgotten that your once truest desire.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even if it is merely a lie to bait a sacrifice. In this suffocating void, pursuing a lie is worth more than facing a hollow eternity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Descend. Towards the end of the Abyss, to touch that single hope. </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fight. Only to confirm your heart is still beating.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Pure, Focused Combat Experience</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Focus on observing enemy movements and seizing every opportunity. Plan your strategy wisely and strike with precision. Any reckless attack or greedy strike can lead to fatal consequences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But this does not mean you are slow or clumsy. Your characters possess agile moves and powerful skills. Unleash their full potential while staying calm under pressure. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3211560/extras/7a25744062afacfb8c8537f3c9ad14b3.poster.avif?t=1773646041\" width=1170 height=414 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3211560/extras/7a25744062afacfb8c8537f3c9ad14b3.webm?t=1773646041\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3211560/extras/7a25744062afacfb8c8537f3c9ad14b3.mp4?t=1773646041\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>The One-Eyed Warrior, skilled in shield combat.</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Unique Playable Characters</strong>   </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From the one-eyed warrior skilled in perfect parries, to the agile rogue wielding dual blades, each character boasts a distinct fighting style. Delve into their unique traits. Harness their strengths. Find your own path to victory.   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3211560/extras/984389ce33e2c3fb8c81e716bb64dd41.poster.avif?t=1773646041\" width=1170 height=414 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3211560/extras/984389ce33e2c3fb8c81e716bb64dd41.webm?t=1773646041\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3211560/extras/984389ce33e2c3fb8c81e716bb64dd41.mp4?t=1773646041\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>The Dual-Blade Rogue, with storm-like speed.</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Challenging Bosses</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face distinct and powerful enemies of the Abyss. Any misjudgment will lead to instant destruction. Only a perfect response ensures survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3211560/extras/1fd89029fe6a732ee2f31f164958f500.poster.avif?t=1773646041\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3211560/extras/1fd89029fe6a732ee2f31f164958f500.webm?t=1773646041\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3211560/extras/1fd89029fe6a732ee2f31f164958f500.mp4?t=1773646041\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>Distinct and Powerful Enemies of the Abyss</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Intense Continuous Battles</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the terrain automatically shifts, battles come at you nonstop. Seize every fleeting moment to recover. Break through one challenge after another.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3211560/extras/b259c3b59750737c2f7f0a22391d48b6.poster.avif?t=1773646041\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3211560/extras/b259c3b59750737c2f7f0a22391d48b6.webm?t=1773646041\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3211560/extras/b259c3b59750737c2f7f0a22391d48b6.mp4?t=1773646041\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>Don't forget to heal during intense battles.</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build a Versatile Combat Style</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gain soul energy through victories to grow stronger. Combine various charms and skills to forge your own unique fighting style. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3211560/extras/655002cbee7751db523f1963aeda4b3b.poster.avif?t=1773646041\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3211560/extras/655002cbee7751db523f1963aeda4b3b.webm?t=1773646041\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3211560/extras/655002cbee7751db523f1963aeda4b3b.mp4?t=1773646041\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>Use Charms to forge your own unique fighting style.</i></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3211560?t=1773646041","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3211560?t=1773646041","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3211560/aed5ce19dde177f8d21064cbd21c45c73248f92c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773646041","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3211560/aed5ce19dde177f8d21064cbd21c45c73248f92c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773646041","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>When everything is devoured by the Abyss, Fight, even if it's just for the sake of feeling your heart beating.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Die Deep</strong> is an action game focused purely on the confrontation with your enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No exploration, no puzzles, no filler. The only core is <strong>Combat</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Observe enemy attacks, find their weaknesses, and devise strategies using precisely executed attacks. One careless mistake in battle, or get too greedy, and it's all over.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Control characters with distinct traits and goals. In a relentless cycle of fierce battles, pursue the mysterious power to rewrite fate. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Step into the Abyss. Face death.</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The World</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When everything is devoured by the Abyss, all desires turn to dust. Wandering souls have long forgotten the instinct to strive, and even the reason to live.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Until the Abyss sends a silent call. It lures you deeper to uncover the forgotten that your once truest desire.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even if it is merely a lie to bait a sacrifice. In this suffocating void, pursuing a lie is worth more than facing a hollow eternity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Descend. Towards the end of the Abyss, to touch that single hope. </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fight. Only to confirm your heart is still beating.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Pure, Focused Combat Experience</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Focus on observing enemy movements and seizing every opportunity. Plan your strategy wisely and strike with precision. Any reckless attack or greedy strike can lead to fatal consequences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But this does not mean you are slow or clumsy. Your characters possess agile moves and powerful skills. Unleash their full potential while staying calm under pressure. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3211560/extras/7a25744062afacfb8c8537f3c9ad14b3.poster.avif?t=1773646041\" width=1170 height=414 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3211560/extras/7a25744062afacfb8c8537f3c9ad14b3.webm?t=1773646041\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3211560/extras/7a25744062afacfb8c8537f3c9ad14b3.mp4?t=1773646041\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>The One-Eyed Warrior, skilled in shield combat.</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Unique Playable Characters</strong>   </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From the one-eyed warrior skilled in perfect parries, to the agile rogue wielding dual blades, each character boasts a distinct fighting style. Delve into their unique traits. Harness their strengths. Find your own path to victory.   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3211560/extras/984389ce33e2c3fb8c81e716bb64dd41.poster.avif?t=1773646041\" width=1170 height=414 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3211560/extras/984389ce33e2c3fb8c81e716bb64dd41.webm?t=1773646041\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3211560/extras/984389ce33e2c3fb8c81e716bb64dd41.mp4?t=1773646041\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>The Dual-Blade Rogue, with storm-like speed.</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Challenging Bosses</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face distinct and powerful enemies of the Abyss. Any misjudgment will lead to instant destruction. Only a perfect response ensures survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3211560/extras/1fd89029fe6a732ee2f31f164958f500.poster.avif?t=1773646041\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3211560/extras/1fd89029fe6a732ee2f31f164958f500.webm?t=1773646041\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3211560/extras/1fd89029fe6a732ee2f31f164958f500.mp4?t=1773646041\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>Distinct and Powerful Enemies of the Abyss</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Intense Continuous Battles</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the terrain automatically shifts, battles come at you nonstop. Seize every fleeting moment to recover. Break through one challenge after another.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3211560/extras/b259c3b59750737c2f7f0a22391d48b6.poster.avif?t=1773646041\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3211560/extras/b259c3b59750737c2f7f0a22391d48b6.webm?t=1773646041\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3211560/extras/b259c3b59750737c2f7f0a22391d48b6.mp4?t=1773646041\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>Don't forget to heal during intense battles.</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build a Versatile Combat Style</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gain soul energy through victories to grow stronger. Combine various charms and skills to forge your own unique fighting style. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3211560/extras/655002cbee7751db523f1963aeda4b3b.poster.avif?t=1773646041\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3211560/extras/655002cbee7751db523f1963aeda4b3b.webm?t=1773646041\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3211560/extras/655002cbee7751db523f1963aeda4b3b.mp4?t=1773646041\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>Use Charms to forge your own unique fighting style.</i></p>","developers":["PINIX"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3211560/header.jpg?t=1773646041","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires an Apple processor<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> OS X Ventura<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Apple M1<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\">